                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.002/81: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Abbott</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-03-09T22:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 9,
                                1924—10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:40
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>44. Legation’s 43, March 8, 11 a.m. Cafandaris cabinet resigned yesterday
                    morning. Reliably informed tonight Regent has asked Papanastasiou, republican
                    leader, to form government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Abbott</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
